# PRD — Product Requirements Document

> **Purpose:** what we are building and how we prove it works. Single source of
> truth for product decisions: requirements, priorities, acceptance criteria,
> success metrics. Written from `VISION.md`, updated per milestone.
>
> **RU:** PRD — «что строим и как докажем, что работает». Единственный источник
> правды по требованиям: приоритеты, критерии приёмки, метрики успеха.

## Metadata
<!-- Keep counters REAL, they are checked by the completeness gate. -->
| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Status | `draft` / `review` / `approved` / `superseded` |
| Version | `1.0` |
| Milestone | `M1` · target date: `YYYY-MM-DD` |
| Linked vision | `docs/VISION.md` (link) |

